classDiagram
    direction LR

    class IIndicatorProvider {
        <<interface, AccessibleTrader.Sdk>>
        +Name: string
        +GetIndicators() List~IndicatorMetadata~
        +Calculate(code, ReadOnlySpan~Ohlcv~, params, IIndicatorResultBuffer) void
        +UpdateLast(code, ReadOnlySpan~Ohlcv~, params, IIndicatorResultBuffer) void
        +GetStabilityWindow(code, params) int
    }
    note for IIndicatorProvider "Span in, buffer out — no allocation on the hot path.<br/>GetStabilityWindow is the causality contract: how many<br/>leading bars are warmup and must not be announced as signal."

