    note for SkenderWrappers "Thin adapters over Skender.Stock.Indicators —<br/>EMA/SMA/ADX, Bollinger/Keltner/Donchian, RSI/Stoch/CCI,<br/>ATR/StdDev, OBV/MFI, MACD/TSI."
    note for AnalyticsBacked "Read from the 17 analytics plugins rather than from price:<br/>funding, open interest, COT positioning, Fear and Greed, on-chain."
